  "dedication": [
    "A gift for Rose.",
    "",
    "If it pleases you, my dear",
    "child, would you record our",
    "future outings? When I'm",
    "old and my mind is fading",
    "I'd like to reminisce all the",
    "times we've spent together",
    "around this fine Kingdom of",
    "mine. Heed the lessons of",
    "our time together and reflect,",
    "for someday you will be",
    "Queen over this great land."
  ],
