        [
          "Tread Carefully",
          "",
          "If you're reading this, things",
          "haven't gone to plan and",
          "YOU should be worried. The",
          "King has been killed and I",
          "am 'Unfit for rule'... I have",
          "enough sanity left to know it",
          "won't be long until they come",
          "for me too. ",
          "",
          "By all means, young",
          "stranger, attempt to rebuild",
          "this memoir, but I'm afraid",
          "you may not like the ending,"
        ],
        [
          "I for one am not a fan. You",
          "may think you're ahead of",
          "the game, but the pieces have",
          "been in motion for decades",
          "and you are just another",
          "pawn, as was I.",
          "",
          "Perhaps we'll meet soon.",
          "",
          "<col=800080>R,<col=000000>"
        ]
